    "## Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "This version keeps the original workflow but makes it safer and easier to maintain:\n",
    "- one consistent naming convention\n",
    "- explicit validation before merges\n",
    "- clear data stages\n",
    "- less fragile file handling\n",
    "- optional separation into scripts for future scaling\n",
    "\n",
    "For production work, consider splitting these into separate scripts:\n",
    "- `data_cleaning.py`\n",
    "- `daily_completion.py`\n",
    "- `calculate_et0_ra.py`\n",
    "- `train_models.py`\n",
    "- `gee_extraction.py`\n"
   ]
